WEBVTT

00:31:00.351 --> 00:31:03.030
AG: Lynda could've simply continued
to develop her skills

00:31:03.054 --> 00:31:04.254
as an expert animator

00:31:04.278 --> 00:31:05.881
and would have had a nice career.

00:31:05.905 --> 00:31:07.857
She could've kept teaching, too,

00:31:07.881 --> 00:31:10.428
but her greatest success
came when her experimentation

00:31:10.452 --> 00:31:12.000
led her into entrepreneurship,

00:31:12.024 --> 00:31:14.403
turning her various
projects into a business.

00:31:15.144 --> 00:31:17.833
She didn't listen to the narrative
that as you get older,

00:31:17.857 --> 00:31:20.111
you should pull over into the slow lane.

00:31:20.135 --> 00:31:22.167
She saw some benefits
of building something

00:31:22.191 --> 00:31:23.405
later in her career.

00:31:23.429 --> 00:31:25.286
LW: By the time you're 40,

00:31:25.310 --> 00:31:27.119
you believe in yourself more.

00:31:27.143 --> 00:31:30.898
You're a more seasoned human being
that has better judgment